  "title": "Deep-Fried Turkey Breast",
  "description": "Deep-fried turkey breast is great practice for frying the whole bird. This recipe uses a savory spice blend as a dry brine, adding so much flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "Cliff G"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-02T03:03:50-04:00",
